<<tag character:Narrator>>
<<tag lore_id:lore_stardome_inscription>>
Narrator: The dome floor is a chart of stars no current almanac admits to.
Narrator: A line of Tartarian script spirals inward toward a single carved point near the centre.
Narrator: "When the thirteenth moon turns its face and the hour reaches seventeen, the throat of the world will hum."
Narrator: "She who listens at the doorway will be the doorway."
Narrator: The carved point at the spiral's heart bears a name worn nearly smooth. Three letters remain — L I R.
===
